🏗️ Generate Semaphore relates files (examples: flag manifest, ...)

Usage:
  semaphore-cli generate [flags]
  semaphore-cli generate [command]

Available Commands:
  manifest    📄 (experimental) Generate an OpenFeature flag manifest based on your flags configuration.

Flags:
  -h, --help[=true|false]   help for generate

Use "semaphore-cli generate [command] --help" for more information about a command.
